From: Your Name <you@example.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 02:10:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Publish chamber temperature to Home Assistant via MQTT
 discovery

Adds a second, plain (non-TLS) MQTT connection to the user's local
broker, separate from the existing TLS connection to the printer.
On connect, publishes a retained Home Assistant MQTT Discovery
config so a 'Chamber Temperature' sensor entity is created
automatically. Configured via a new optional 'homeassistant' block
in xtouch.json (host/port/user/password/enabled); the feature is a
no-op if that block is absent.
